    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="54.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 54.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 gif se landrica nelle to steore filstan, þonne habbe Crist 7 cyningc þa bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the lord of the estate will not help in the punishment, then Christ and the king are to have the compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if the local lord will not aid in the enforcement, then Christ and the king are to receive the compensation.</ab>
      </div>
